युयुधानो विराटश्च द्रुपदश्च महारथः ॥ ४ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":211,\"bb\":202,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/1/4/b202/\",\"body_value\":\"atra śūrā maheṣv-āsā
bhīmārjuna-samā yudhi
